[00:00.00] 作词 : Morgan Wallen/Michael Hardy/Josh Miller/Ernest Keith Smith/Ryan Vojtesak
[00:00.00][by:土豆头_先生]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Morgan Wallen/Michael Hardy/Josh Miller/Ernest Keith Smith/Ryan Vojtesak
[00:15.01]You see the way that I look out the window
[00:15.01]你看我望着窗外发呆的样子  
[00:18.23]I see the way that you lean on the wine
[00:18.23]我看你靠着酒杯，神情恍惚  
[00:21.56]Why we lyin'? What we tryin' to pretend for?
[00:21.56]咱们还骗什么，装什么呢？  
[00:24.48]We both know we got goodbye on our minds
[00:24.48]心里都有数这段感情早就走到头了  
[00:28.68]Couple broke hearts runnin' on fumes
[00:28.68]两个心碎的人还在苦苦硬撑  
[00:31.76]Last time I wanna see you cry
[00:31.76]我不想再看到你流泪的模样  
[00:34.81]So I'ma do what you'll never do
[00:34.81]所以我要去做你始终不肯做的事  
[00:39.07]We had a good run, it's time to walk away
[00:39.07]我们曾经很好，但现在是时候离开了  
[00:42.37]We done said it all, so all I got to say is
[00:42.37]该说的都说完了，我只剩一句话  
[00:46.24]Don't say, "Don't," baby, let me just do it
[00:46.24]别说“别走”，宝贝，就让我来做个了断  
[00:49.26]For good kinda gone like there ain't nothin' to it
[00:49.26]彻底离开干净利落 别再纠缠  
[00:52.87]Open your eyes, ain't no sense in us seein' it through
[00:52.87]睁开眼看看，继续下去也没有意义  
[00:56.09]Startin' a fight every time after drinkin' a few
[00:56.09]喝了几杯就要吵一架这样的日子够了  
[00:59.27]I'm gettin' tired of just tryin' to get even with you
[00:59.27]我已经厌倦了厌倦了和你斗气  
[01:02.39]You'll thank me later, baby, leavin's the least I could do
[01:02.39]你以后会感谢我的，宝贝 离开是我能为你做的最后一件好事  
[01:18.19]Don't even try to call me up and talk me out of it
[01:18.19]别打电话来求我回头也别劝我留下  
[01:21.47]I'll be runnin' every horse underneath the hood
[01:21.47]我义无反顾所有的事情  
[01:24.57]Ain't like we didn't see this goin' off the tracks comin'
[01:24.57]咱们都知道这段感情早就偏离了轨道  
